    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d386">

                <pb facs="0534" n="514" sameAs="frus:frus1950v07/pg514"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/8–150</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by Mr. George H. Butler of the Policy
                        Planning Staff to the Department of State Representative on the NSC
                        Staff</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bishop</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1950-08-01">August 1, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>With reference to your memorandum of July 31, 1950<anchor n="1" xml:id="d386-f1"
                    /> to Mr. Watts regarding future U.S. policy with respect to Korea, there are
                    attached three copies of revisions of some of the paragraphs.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d386-f2"/>
                </p>
                <pb facs="0535" n="515" xml:id="pg515"/>
                <p>These revisions are based upon comment made at the Under Secretary’s Meeting of
                    July 28. They also reflect comment made by Mr. Jessup.</p>
                <p>Messrs. Allison, Sandifer, and Wells and I agreed that work on this paper should
                    go ahead but that another paper would be necessary to complete the study. This
                    point is covered in the final paragraph of the revision.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Butler</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d386-a1.xml" xpointer="d386-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d386-f1" n="1" xml:id="d386-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d386-f2" n="2" xml:id="d386-f2-content">
                <p>References in the annexed document are to the paragraphs of the draft memorandum
                    by the Policy Planning Staff of July 25, <ref target="#pg469">p. 469</ref>, as
                    it had gone forward to the NSC Staff, bearing the date July 27 and with no
                    changes in the text but with the paragraphs renumbered.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
